{"parse":{"title":"Golden Beagle's Dream","pageid":451321,"revid":2141046,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Golden Beagle&#39;s Dream</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/ba/Constellation_Golden_Beagle%27s_Dream.png/revision/latest?cb=20260408033841\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Golden Beagle&#39;s Dream\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/ba/Constellation_Golden_Beagle%27s_Dream.png/revision/latest?cb=20260408033841\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/ba/Constellation_Golden_Beagle%27s_Dream.png/revision/latest?cb=20260408033841 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/ba/Constellation_Golden_Beagle%27s_Dream.png/revision/latest?cb=20260408033841 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Golden Beagle&#39;s Dream\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Golden_Beagle%27s_Dream.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Golden Beagle&#39;s Dream.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Linnea\" title=\"Linnea\">Linnea</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fairyland%27s_Farewell_Gift\" title=\"Fairyland&#39;s Farewell Gift\">Fairyland's Farewell Gift</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The effects of the Constellation, Provisional Classification, are enhanced: When unleashing Elemental Skill <a href=\"/wiki/Countermeasure:_Lumi%27s_Battle_Cry!\" title=\"Countermeasure: Lumi&#39;s Battle Cry!\">Countermeasure: Lumi's Battle Cry!</a>, or when triggering Moondrift Harmony, Linnea will directly gain the maximum number of Field Catalog stacks. When consuming Field Catalog, consume twice the original number of stacks, such that the increase in DMG will be boosted to 150% of the original value.<br /><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b>: Lunar-Crystallize Reaction DMG dealt by nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> members is <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">elevated</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Elevation</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.</span></span></span> by 25%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DMG Elevation\">DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Crystallize_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Crystallize DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Crystallize DMG Elevation</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Golden Beagle's Dream</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Linnea\" title=\"Linnea\">Linnea</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_6_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 6 Constellation\">Level 6 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in